# Cloudflare Pages security headers
# This file is IGNORED by Vercel (which uses vercel.json for headers).
# Activates automatically when deployed to Cloudflare Pages.
#
# IMPORTANT — Content-Security-Policy:
# Do NOT add a restrictive CSP without verifying these external scripts are allowed:
#   - Stripe.js: https://js.stripe.com
#   - Google Maps JS API: https://maps.googleapis.com, https://maps.gstatic.com
#   - Google Fonts: https://fonts.googleapis.com, https://fonts.gstatic.com
# Add CSP only after auditing all external script/style/connect sources.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(self)
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
